  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Azalea Blue, where luxury meets charm, perfectly positioned in Old Seagrove Beach! Offering a county owned public beach with no restrictions on access or recreation. With plenty of shady nooks, beautiful stretches of sun-soaked beach, and lots of fun to go around, Seagrove is the perfect beach community for families looking for a laid back, yet luxurious vibe. Enter the dramatic, scalloped archway up a shaded, cobblestone drive to find that every inch of this home is outfitted with comfort & quality in mind…elegant furnishings, exquisite lighting, & unique beach chic home decor. Every detail was considered and no expense was spared!<br><br>The first floor features a living area filled with natural light courtesy of vaulted ceilings clad in perky cypress and huge Capiz Honeycomb Pendants. A two-sided fireplace helps define the space and open walls on either side link the living room to a cozy sunroom. A modern gourmet kitchen featuring soapstone countertops and Thermador appliances, including a French door refrigerator-freezer and six-burner gas range with indoor griddle & double oven is adjacent to a large dining area. Two bedrooms and two full baths are found on the first floor along with limed-oak flooring throughout. Ascend to the second level to discover the master suite, custom-built bunkroom, & two additional bedrooms, all of which offer en suite baths. This floor also hosts the perfect coffee/wet bar combo for the ultimate morning brew, afternoon pick-me-up, or after-hours nightcap & a cozy TV nook for all ages to enjoy! And out back, the fun really begins! Azalea Blue offers a beautifully designed outdoor area with a heated pool, furnished sundeck, gas grill, & a covered outdoor dining set for those looking to dine alfresco.<br><br>Nestled in-between Seaside & Watercolor, there are a plethora of places to go & things to see…stunning views, amazing food, upscale boutiques, live music, movies under the stars & even a farmer’s market every Saturday. <br><br>Parties, events, smoking, & pets are strictly prohibited. Guests found in violation are subject to eviction with no refund.<br><br>ACCOMODATIONS/FLOOR:<br>1st FLOOR<br>*Master Bedroom w/ King Bed, Full Bath, Walk-In Closet, Desk, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Guest Bedroom w/ King Bed, Full Bath, Side-by-Side Closets, & Flat Screen TV<br><br>2nd FLOOR<br>*Master Suite w/ King Bed, Stunning Master Bath w/ White Marble, Walk-In Shower, & Soaking Tub, Small Sitting Area, Side-by-Side Closets, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Guest Bedroom w/ King Bed, Full Bath, Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Guest Bedroom w/ 2 Double Beds, Full Bath, Closet, & Flat Screen TV<br>*Custom-Built Bunkroom w/ 2 Double Over Double Beds, Full Bath, Open Air Closet w/ Cubbies, and 4 USB Charging Stations<br>*TV Nook w/ Convertible Sofa<br><br>HIGHLIGHTS: <br>*0.2 Miles Walk to Beach Access<br>*County Owned Beach – Public Beaches w/ NO Restrictions on Access or Recreation<br>*0.9 Miles to Publix<br>*No Smoking/Pets Permitted<br>*Minimum Age Requirement to Rent is 25<br>*Must be 1 Adult to Accompany Each 4 Guests Under the Age of 25<br>*No Parties/Events Allowed<br><br>AMENITIES:<br>*Private Heated Pool - Pool Heating is an Additional $45/Day<br>*Parking for Up to 4 Vehicles (Driveway Only)<br>*Thermador Luxury Kitchen Appliances<br>*Wet/Coffee Bar w/ Mini Fridge<br>*Outdoor Shower<br>*Gas Grill<br>*Wi-Fi<br><br>DINING/DRINKS/TREATS/SHOPPING NEARBY:<br>*Bud & Alley’s<br>*Food Truck Row in Central Square<br>*Seaside Farmer’s Market - Every Saturday in Central Square<br>*Cafe Thirty-A<br>*Surfing Deer<br>*Old Florida Fishhouse<br>*Beachy Bean Coffee Co.<br>*The Perfect Pig<br>*Seagrove Village Market Cafe",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Where Luxury Meets Charm w/ Private Pool & 6 Beach Bikes"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
